      "content": "i get that but i'm just worried because he's so exhausted and he's struggling in school because of it. it's not like it's a dangerous drug or anything, right? it's just a vitamin/mineral. if he really needs the iron to fix the anemia, wouldn't more iron just get the job done quicker? i just want him to feel better soon.",
